   <text:p text:style-name="P103" loext:marker-style-name="T37"><text:span text:style-name="T37">After logging in to Apple Developer, click on </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T45">Certificates, IDs and Profiles</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T37">. Press the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T45">All</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T37"> selection under </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T45">Devices</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T37"> as shown in the illustration below and then select </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T45">Register Multiple Devices</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T37">. Then press the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T45">Choose File</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T37"> button.</text:span></text:p>
